<details class="help-topic command-topic">
  <summary><code>gamebot unregister &lt;player&gt;</code></summary>
  <p dir="auto">Captains can remove users.</p>
<pre class="notranslate"><code class="notranslate">gamebot unregister @WangHoe

I've removed @WangHoe from the leaderboard.
</code></pre>
