<details class="help-topic command-topic">
  <summary><code>gamebot set gifs on|off</code></summary>
  <p dir="auto">Enable/disable GIFs for your team.</p>
<pre class="notranslate"><code class="notranslate">gamebot set gifs off

GIFs are now off.
</code></pre>
<p dir="auto"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="<%= h asset_path('/img/commands/gifs.gif') %>"><img src="<%= h asset_path('/img/commands/gifs.gif') %>" alt="Example of gamebot set gifs on|off" loading="lazy"></a></p>
