<details class="help-topic command-topic">
  <summary><code>gamebot set leaderboard max [number|none]</code></summary>
  <p dir="auto">Set and reset the leaderboard max. The default is none, ie. to show the entire leaderboard.</p>
<pre class="notranslate"><code class="notranslate">gamebot set leaderboard max 5
</code></pre>
<p dir="auto">The following are equivalent.</p>
<pre class="notranslate"><code class="notranslate">gamebot set leaderboard max 0
